| **Command**                         | **Description**                            |
| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| `docker compose up`                 | Start services in foreground               |
| `docker compose up -d`              | Start in detached (background) mode        |
| `docker compose down`               | Stop and remove containers, networks, etc. |
| `docker compose logs`               | View logs of all services                  |
| `docker compose logs opencart`      | View logs of just the `opencart` container |
| `docker compose ps`                 | See running containers                     |
| `docker compose exec opencart bash` | Open terminal inside opencart container    |
| `docker volume ls`                  | List Docker volumes                        |
| `docker volume rm VOLUME_NAME`      | Remove unused volume                       |
| `docker compose restart`            | Restart services                           |
| `docker images`                     | List all images                            |
| `docker rm -f $(docker ps -aq)`     | stop Remove all containers (be careful!)   |




